n\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Repulsion\",\"overview\":\"Beautiful young manicurist Carole suffers from androphobia (the pathological fear of interaction with men). When her sister and roommate, Helen, leaves their London flat to go on an Italian holiday with her married boyfriend, Carole withdraws into her apartment. She begins to experience frightful hallucinations, her fear gradually mutating into madness.\",\"popularity\":4.3338,\"poster_path\":\"\\/dtyCKEPLqv9wxyVazL4b843vtUb.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1965-06-01\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.364,\"vote_count\":1141},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/qDqp7ud3bGQQ72pOFsPKLNypkKp.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18,36],\"id\":11515,\"title\":\"Goya\'s Ghosts\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Goya\'s Ghosts\",\"overview\":\"Painter Francisco Goya becomes involved with the Spanish Inquisition after his muse, In\\u00e9s, is arrested by the church for heresy. Her family turns to him, hoping that his connection with fanatical Inquisitor Lorenzo, whom he is painting, can secure her release.\",\"popularity\":3.6236,\"poster_path\":\"\\/tyZhS8kA07oU5fO3ruamJkgAC0M.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2006-11-08\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.6,\"vote_count\":549},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/vinvnwLFRuVgRQHDZvFcehVyuBk.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18,10770],\"id\":829883,\"title\":\"4th Dimension\",\"original_language\":\"bn\",\"original_title\":\"\\u099a\\u09a4\\u09c1\\u09b0\\u09cd\\u09a5 \\u09ae\\u09be\\u09a4\\u09cd\\u09b0\\u09be\",\"overview\":\"The story of a lonely man who is caught in a perpetual cycle of time. He hangs in limbo, between reality and dreams. His only companions are a maid, a cat, and a grandfather clock. The same things are happening in his life and he becomes increasingly frustrated.\",\"popularity\":2.3284,\"poster_path\":null,\"release_date\":\"2001-01-01\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":0,\"vote_coun