e Ides of March\",\"overview\":\"Dirty tricks stand to soil an ambitious young press spokesman\'s idealism in a cutthroat presidential campaign where \'victory\' is relative.\",\"popularity\":8.4046,\"poster_path\":\"\\/w8t4UnJnC24S9ygoaFgmMzRbErd.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2011-10-07\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.677,\"vote_count\":2805},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/vZuAKGPq0uRyvXg0A1ONxhBQogS.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35,18,10752],\"id\":279641,\"title\":\"Whiskey Tango Foxtrot\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Whiskey Tango Foxtrot\",\"overview\":\"Stuck in a rut, reporter Kim Baker decides to shake things up by leaving her desk job in New York and taking a dangerous assignment in Afghanistan. Far from home and completely out of her comfort zone, a culture-shocked Kim befriends an adventurous reporter Tanya Vanderpoel, a stern Colonel, and a charming photojournalist to help her navigate this crazy new world.\",\"popularity\":4.9436,\"poster_path\":\"\\/wAxhQsY63VY6eF3EilXTkX0YRoU.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2016-03-04\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.316,\"vote_count\":1076},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/9dixOiaWMKAJiqBiIf7GgHADsG4.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[10402,18,10749],\"id\":10028,\"title\":\"Honey\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Honey\",\"overview\":\"Honey Daniels dreams of making a name for herself as a hip-hop choreographer. When she\'s not busy hitting downtown clubs with her friends, she teaches dance classes at a nearby community center in Harlem, N.Y., as a way to keep kids off the streets. Honey thinks she\'s hit the jackpot when she meets a hotshot director casts her in one of his music videos. But, when he starts demanding sexual favors from her, Honey makes a decision that will change her life.\",\"popularity\":6.1865,\"poster_path\":\"\\/gnY6d7BoddAAQ8s42fxCJK8lL1A.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2003-12-05\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":