ving Celie to find companionship anywhere she can. She perseveres, holding on to her dream of one day being reunited with her sister in Africa.\",\"popularity\":7.2541,\"poster_path\":\"\\/6bvxkcTAXyqxGRwo38mxw92D6Xr.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1985-12-18\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.7,\"vote_count\":2040},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/uA8eSNAUUUyfHNIrG4h0zHxzt9W.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18],\"id\":510,\"title\":\"One Flew Over the Cuckoo\'s Nest\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"One Flew Over the Cuckoo\'s Nest\",\"overview\":\"A petty criminal fakes insanity to serve his sentence in a mental ward rather than prison. He soon finds himself as a leader to the other patients\\u2014and an enemy to the cruel, domineering nurse who runs the ward.\",\"popularity\":20.6863,\"poster_path\":\"\\/kjWsMh72V6d8KRLV4EOoSJLT1H7.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1975-11-19\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":8.404,\"vote_count\":11804},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/abF5X1C7KMJEJnbB7KidfHOIszj.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18,80],\"id\":11699,\"title\":\"Bad Lieutenant: Port of Call New Orleans\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Bad Lieutenant: Port of Call New Orleans\",\"overview\":\"Terrence McDonagh is a New Orleans Police sergeant, who receives a medal and a promotion to lieutenant for heroism during Hurricane Katrina. Due to his heroic act, McDonagh injures his back and becomes addicted to prescription pain medication. He then finds himself involved with a drug dealer who is suspected of murdering a family of African immigrants.\",\"popularity\":8.9574,\"poster_path\":\"\\/zRULXsd0rb1lVfnSyQkYPi2nLcB.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2009-09-11\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.178,\"vote_count\":1320},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/qPpxdckpS7tYddVN3yA3lnGFbTS.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18,35],\"id\":1219971,\"title\":\"SCIOM\\u00c8N - Domenica era un bel giorno per andare in TV\",\"ori