iew\":\"A boy declares his love for his girlfriend, only to die the same night. He is brought back to life by his mother as a flesh-craving zombie, who sires more teen undead while trying to control his, er, appetite for his beloved.\",\"popularity\":2.2278,\"poster_path\":\"\\/kMWuWQeysCuO4L9Ry235VsXAZZ.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2005-08-02\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":4.9,\"vote_count\":57},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/hEQYZq2CDB2LSJVxxlazdBOKeyW.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[37,18,12],\"id\":281957,\"title\":\"The Revenant\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Revenant\",\"overview\":\"In the 1820s, a frontiersman, Hugh Glass, sets out on a path of vengeance against those who left him for dead after a bear mauling.\",\"popularity\":24.7588,\"poster_path\":\"\\/ji3ecJphATlVgWNY0B0RVXZizdf.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2015-12-25\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":7.541,\"vote_count\":19757},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[27,28],\"id\":1226189,\"title\":\"Skater Zombies: The Villain\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Skater Zombies: The Villain\",\"overview\":\"In a post apocalyptic world, in which only skateboarders exist, a new synthetic drug has been quietly circulating around the globe and turning female skaters into kick-ass Killer Zombies. The planet\'s only hope lies with a small cohort of co-ed pro skaters-determined to take a stand and save civilization. Richie Jackson portrays the ultimate \\\"anti-Villain\\\", obsessed with bringing back anarchy to skateboarding culture. Who will win this retro-clash of culture and chaos?\",\"popularity\":0.8273,\"poster_path\":\"\\/8KczNqa78Sg3weynl4AS8L0PvDD.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2024-01-27\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":0,\"vote_count\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/8eIjBetuGK2F1wwFUJ0JyPbAxMb.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[878,27],\"id\":26946,\"title\":\"Attack of the Crab Monsters\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Attack of the Crab Monsters\",\"overview\":\"A group of scientists travel to a remote island to study the effects of nuclear weapons tests, only to get stranded when their airplane mysteriously explodes. The team soon discovers that the tests have given rise to crabs mutated into intelligent, impervious, telepathic giants intent on increasing their numbers by breeding, then travelling to populated areas to feed, and which do not intend to be stopped by their discoverers.\",\"popularity\":2.5812,\"poster_path\":\"\\/pDaJt3Jv41mOvND7HaDnmiGsD5V.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1957-02-10\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.2,\"vote_count\":86},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/g1p7uOEcfcDmwztyEzUmkGagG47.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27],\"id\":26954,\"title\":\"Puppet Master II\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Puppet Master II\",\"overview\":\"A new team of paranormal researchers has come to the hotel to investigate its murder-soaked past; the puppets -- led by a new member, Torch -- shed some light on the matter, as they tunnel, burn, strangle and hook to survive.\",\"popularity\":3.0194,\"poster_path\":\"\\/dy5tzZFWFTjbNyG4KNP6yMjZ6l9.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1990-02-07\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6,\"vote_count\":225},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[27],\"id\":27028,\"title\":\"Living Dead Lock Up\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Living Dead Lock Up\",\"overview\":\"A deep buried secret threatens the inhabitants of Stone Gate Penitentiary. When a petty car thief is sentenced to the prison, he encounters more than he expected. A bizarre occurrence unleashes a hoard of possessed Zombies out into the institute. Now he and his cell mate Miguel must find a way to break out of prison and rescue his girlfriend before they become one of the living dead.\",\"popularity\":1.0583,\"poster_path\":\"\\/7iKkqPH9sgwg3oOQP0nK0sCCGUt.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2005-01-01\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":2.2,\"vote_count\":4},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/9tcIzvTfIYkoxjLiTcaXdMwfzT6.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27],\"id\":26860,\"title\":\"White Zombie\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"White Zombie\",\"overview\":\"A wealthy landowner living in Haiti convinces a sorcerer to lure the woman he has fallen for away from her fianc\\u00e9. The madman later betrays their agreement by keeping the woman for himself\\u2026as a zombie.\",\"popularity\":2.4696,\"poster_path\":\"\\/s5DnfWHGeCExlweIFF4JOHKyx3H.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1932-07-28\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6,\"vote_count\":288},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[35,27],\"id\":281707,\"title\":\"The Horror Vault 3\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Horror Vault 3\",\"overview\":\"Five new stories of grueling horror: A Christmas Haunting, Zombie Office, Undone, Unchangeable and The Psychomanteum - ghosts, zombies and bloody revenge.\",\"popularity\":1.1349,\"poster_path\":\"\\/jCeZX7GfVTN5QkgA0ocS3duNxop.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2010-07-13\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":2.2,\"vote_count\":5},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/8mGRw6FPEEPT8G2ZfFQczT9Zwsz.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18,27,35],\"id\":26901,\"title\":\"Otto; or, Up with Dead People\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Otto; or, Up with Dead People\",\"overview\":\"A young zombie named Otto appears on a remote highway. He has no idea where he came from or where he is going. After hitching a ride to Berlin and nesting in an abandoned amusement park, he begins to explore the city. Soon he is discovered by underground filmmaker Medea Yarn, who begins to make a documentary about him with the support of her girlfriend, Hella Bent, and her brother Adolf, who operates the camera. Meanwhile, Medea is still trying to finish Up with Dead People, the epic political-porno-zombie movie that she has been working on for years. She convinces its star, Fritz Fritze, to allow the vulnerable Otto to stay in his guest bedroom. When Otto discovers that he has a wallet that contains information about his past, before he was dead, he begins to remember details about his ex-boyfriend, Rudolf. He arranges to meet him at the schoolyard where they met, with devastating results.\",\"popularity\":1.5867,\"poster_path\":\"\\/xGmyTOXACi6Va1RX5pqCCQgckss.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2008-01-19\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.3,\"vote_count\":52},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/hjycsXyJRwFkEtWMEyhWNZdJDLe.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27,28],\"id\":27231,\"title\":\"Colin\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Colin\",\"overview\":\"Our hero Colin is bitten by a zombie; he dies and returns from the dead. We follow him as he wanders through suburbia during the throes of a cadaverous apocalypse.\",\"popularity\":2.3339,\"poster_path\":\"\\/o2n6IfxHoBSFmvKd7R04qFTF5eG.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2008-11-15\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":4.4,\"vote_count\":32},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/jvnrGpr0KlYzaZoJS96UizxVWw0.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35,27],\"id\":27070,\"title\":\"Chopper Chicks in Zombietown\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Chopper Chicks in Zombietown\",\"overview\":\"Riding around on their motorbikes, a gang of tough women bikers are the only thing that stands between a crowd of zombies, which have been accidentally let out of their secure cave, and those still alive in the town.\",\"popularity\":2.9845,\"poster_path\":\"\\/2iViC9lCEmmrDHir1sBLcPV690U.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1989-04-05\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":4.7,\"vote_count\":38},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/nKW8mFuTK737Cy6TtE8tyVbxfyS.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27],\"id\":26772,\"title\":\"Flick\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Flick\",\"overview\":\"Memphis cop Lieutenant McKenzie is called in to investigate a series of strange deaths and wierd sightings following the resurrection of a murder victim from the 1950s(a local boy) who is brought back to life in modern times and tries to find his teenage sweetheart who is now aged 62 and also to seek revenge for his death.\",\"popularity\":1.5935,\"poster_path\":\"\\/dpdQ5igAxSFNHsEQ5MLOqHFEEBb.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2008-10-03\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":4,\"vote_count\":11},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/q9JBc3KM8Z7LPACxrCl9CqWyfcV.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27,35,14],\"id\":26677,\"title\":\"The Video Dead\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Video Dead\",\"overview\":\"On a quiet, tree-lined street, an old television set receives a single channel that repeats the same horror film over and over, freeing zombies from the grave to kill.\",\"popularity\":1.4904,\"poster_path\":\"\\/hsYfuS1kWb41aPf8ka7rgrYuMpP.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1987-11-06\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.2,\"vote_count\":123},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/u2Wn3iMY59mkzHDTidccAceDyFA.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27,35],\"id\":26678,\"title\":\"Night Life\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Night Life\",\"overview\":\"Archie works part-time at his uncle\'s mortuary and is harassed by a few of the popular kids because of it. His harassers die in an automobile accident, and the bodies are taken to his uncle\'s mortuary. Archie is pulling a late night at the mortuary when he sees a storm brewing. Lightening strikes! They\'re alive! The preppie bullies continue to torment him...as zombies!\",\"popularity\":1.9035,\"poster_path\":\"\\/rTkBreMkbntUTLn3bakqyJqRD1r.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1989-09-18\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.5,\"vote_count\":28},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/dRaoGQbXnb3MGo7CxJgVHwGpZOP.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27,878,10752],\"id\":26680,\"title\":\"Shock Waves\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Shock Waves\",\"overview\":\"Visitors to a remote island discover that a reclusive Nazi commandant has been breeding a group of zombie soldiers.\",\"popularity\":2.9147,\"poster_path\":\"\\/ApYarwDS09ll1I1zZV9XFUe6aGe.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1977-07-15\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":4.846,\"vote_count\":140},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/asO6UtEqDB9bdJzDDjnSzNZf3vY.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18,27,9648,878],\"id\":1422052,\"title\":\"Descendent\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Descendent\",\"overview\":\"After a traumatic brain injury triggers terrifying visions of extraterrestrials and a newfound talent for drawing, a father-to-be begins to question his reality and becomes obsessed with the need to protect his family from an unseen threat.\",\"popularity\":2.425,\"poster_path\":\"\\/Of1UCdomAu0mJY2SNHHGjhnvx9.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2025-08-08\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.7,\"vote_count\":68},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/jmW9NkzbpI9vhyxJU2x644Nj7VU.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27],\"id\":1421903,\"title\":\"Werwulf\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Werwulf\",\"overview\":\"A harrowing tale of devotion, damnation and the devil within.\",\"popularity\":11.4128,\"poster_path\":\"\\/imnkSt4PSQpxIuyiRpJCiLk3SZz.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-12-25\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":0,\"vote_count\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"\\/9GDDzQ52GuGOuDeNRTuPz8NpCCG.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27,53],\"id\":26588,\"title\":\"Summer\'s Blood\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Summer\'s Blood\",\"overview\":\"A demented handyman comes to the rescue of a young woman, then imprisons her in his basement.\",\"popularity\":2.4585,\"poster_path\":\"\\/pEDtMNONPumVCyhJQjeqVZyvVD.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2009-11-02\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.4,\"vote_count\":105},{\"adult\":false,\"